// The special root: look() for shape 869.
//
// WHY THIS CLASS IS PINNED TO 869 AND CANNOT MOVE. The engine picks the
// usecode class for an item's events from its SHAPE NUMBER:
//
//     uint32 class_id = _shape;          // item.cpp:1516
//
// so shape 869's look() lands in class 869 and nowhere else, as the
// elixir's lands in 868 (ELIXIR.UNK). `lv_manifest.json` pins
// TYPESPECIALROOT to 869 for that reason. Decided on 2026-10-11
// (docs/art-track.md contract 12): the root gets its own shape and a name.
//
// THE ITEM. The root Ezrekal brews into Tyorvi's elixir, found "by the
// standing stones" (EZREKAL.UNK:3108) at the Sacred Circle's east stone
// (build_map_10.py). Her two filters find it as `(type = TypeWeedz) and
// (frame = 0)` in the Avatar's pack (lv-patched/EZREKAL.UNK R2), and
// TypeWeedz resolves to 869 in u8c_symbols TYPE_SHAPES. Until 2026-10-11
// it was shape 399 frame 9, which the engine names "eye of newt".
//
// THE NAME is the record's ("Special Root", items.yaml). No use(): a
// double-click does nothing, as before.

uses "item";

typeclass TypeSpecialRoot inherits Item
{
	process look();
}

process TypeSpecialRoot::look()
{
	bark("special root");
}
